;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"paralympics2\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/consult-ant.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/paralympics2.gif?fit=685%2C577&amp;ssl=1\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Open image 2 of 2 in full-screen\"srcset=\"https:\/\/consult-ant.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/paralympics2.gif?strip=info&#038;w=600 600w,https:\/\/consult-ant.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/paralympics2.gif?strip=info&#038;w=900 900w,https:\/\/consult-ant.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/paralympics2.gif?strip=info&#038;w=1197 1197w\" alt=\"\" data-height=\"1008\" data-id=\"928\" data-link=\"https:\/\/consult-ant.uk\/paralympics2\/\" data-url=\"https:\/\/consult-ant.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/paralympics2.gif\" data-width=\"1197\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/consult-ant.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/paralympics2.gif?w=685&#038;ssl=1\" data-amp-layout=\"responsive\" \/><\/figure><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The bottom part of the sketch didn&#8217;t make it in &#8211; but the top part was pretty much exactly what I ended up with.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-light-gray-color has-text-color has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Multi-Part Sketch<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">My Fields of Gold Makeover Monday sketches were slightly more exploratory, and showed my thinking around layout and charts:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"588\" data-attachment-id=\"1002\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/consult-ant.uk\/mm_21_11_sketch1\/\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/consult-ant.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/mm_21_11_sketch1.png?fit=852%2C731&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"852,731\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"mm_21_11_sketch1\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/consult-ant.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/mm_21_11_sketch1.png?fit=685%2C588&amp;ssl=1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/consult-ant.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/mm_21_11_sketch1.png?resize=685%2C588&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1002\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">With the final design looking similar to the last sketch, and I kept the charts pretty simple.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-jetpack-tiled-gallery aligncenter is-style-rectangular\"><div class=\"tiled-gallery__gallery\"><div class=\"tiled-gallery__row\"><div class=\"tiled-gallery__col\" style=\"flex-basis:50.98785%;\"><figure class=\"tiled-gallery__item\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"1004\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/consult-ant.uk\/mm_21_11_sketch2\/\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/consult-ant.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/mm_21_11_sketch2.png?fit=700%2C414&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"700,414\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&